WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:32.458


2
00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.541
<b>Here, Lord Krishna says,</b>

3
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:41.583
<b>just as humans discard their old clothes and</b>
<b>acquire new ones,</b>

4
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.625
<b>similarly,</b>

5
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:45.750
<b>the soul leaves an old, worn-out body</b>

6
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:49.291
<b>and enters a new one.</b>

7
00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:54.333


8
00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:57.500
<b>Perhaps in Arjun's mind, this thought arises</b>

9
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.833
<b>even if we accept that the soul never dies,</b>

10
00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:05.958
<b>doesn't it experience joy through</b>
<b>the body it inhabits?</b>

11
00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:10.416
<b>Won't the soul then grieve when</b>
<b>this body is destroyed?</b>

12
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:13.083
<b>The answer to such thinking is this:</b>

13
00:01:13.083 --> 00:01:17.250
<b>To the soul, this body is merely a garment.</b>

14
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:20.083
<b>The day this garment becomes old,</b>

15
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.125
<b>no longer fit to dwell in,</b>

16
00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:25.833
<b>the soul will simply wear another body.</b>

17
00:01:25.833 --> 00:01:27.541
<b>Think of it this way</b>

18
00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:32.333
<b>do we lament before discarding old clothes?</b>

19
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:33.541
<b>If we reflect,</b>

20
00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:36.791
<b>we know from the very moment</b>

21
00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:38.125
<b>that a day will come</b>

22
00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:40.208
<b>when these clothes will grow old,</b>

23
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.875
<b>perhaps tear, become unwearable.</b>

24
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:49.833
<b>Then we simply discard them and</b>
<b>once again purchase and wear new clothes.</b>

25
00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:52.541
<b>This is the continuous process </b>

26
00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:54.500
<b>of physical life.</b>

27
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:55.583
<b>Similarly,</b>

28
00:01:55.583 --> 00:02:01.375
<b>to think the soul would grieve for</b>
<b>any body would be incorrect.</b>

29
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:06.333
<b>The soul simply leaves one body</b>
<b>to wear another.</b>

30
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.291


31
00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:12.708
<b>Think,</b>

32
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:16.000
<b>before you are placed two objects:</b>

33
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.458
<b>A bundle of old, soiled cloth,</b>

34
00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:25.125
<b>and beside it, a gleaming new box.</b>

35
00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:27.541
<b>What would you choose?</b>

36
00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:28.333
<b>Perhaps</b>

37
00:02:28.333 --> 00:02:31.541
<b>you would first want to know</b>

38
00:02:31.541 --> 00:02:38.083
<b>what lies within that old bundle</b>
<b>and that shining box?</b>

39
00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:43.750
<b>And if you were told that one contains</b>
<b>a precious diamond,</b>

40
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:47.041
<b>and the other mere garbage?</b>

41
00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:48.583
<b>Then?</b>

42
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:50.875
<b>What would you choose?</b>

43
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:57.250
<b>Forgetting the box, you would only want to know</b>
<b>which one holds the diamond.</b>

44
00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.083
<b>Because</b>

45
00:02:58.083 --> 00:03:02.125
<b>it matters not how the outer covering appears,</b>

46
00:03:02.125 --> 00:03:07.291
<b>for the true value lies in the diamond within.</b>

47
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:10.333
<b>Not in the outer covering.</b>

48
00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:13.083
<b>The true existence is of the soul,</b>

49
00:03:13.083 --> 00:03:15.416
<b>not the outer body.</b>

50
00:03:15.416 --> 00:03:20.083
<b>What lies within is what matters.</b>

51
00:03:20.083 --> 00:03:21.333
<b>But</b>

52
00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:24.250
<b>do we follow this wisdom?</b>

53
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:30.625
<b>In our inclination towards physical beauty</b>
<b>and outer garments,</b>

54
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:34.458
<b>we forget the soul within.</b>

55
00:03:34.458 --> 00:03:38.875
<b>For your elevation, value spirituality.</b>

56
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:40.875
<b>Nourish the soul,</b>

57
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:43.333
<b>take refuge in spiritual wisdom.</b>

58
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:47.041
<b>Contemplate on this matter.</b>

59
00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:49.458
<b>Polish the diamond within you.</b>

60
00:03:49.458 --> 00:03:53.375
<b>That alone is most precious.</b>

61
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.791


62
00:03:57.791 --> 00:04:02.958
<b>When you're drawn to someone,</b>

63
00:04:02.958 --> 00:04:05.791
<b>what attracts you?</b>

64
00:04:05.791 --> 00:04:08.041
<b>Their attire,</b>

65
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:09.791
<b>their beauty,</b>

66
00:04:09.791 --> 00:04:11.958
<b>their outward behaviour,</b>

67
00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:13.500
<b>isn’t it?</b>

68
00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.375
<b>It’s natural,</b>

69
00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:16.958
<b>that without knowing them,</b>

70
00:04:16.958 --> 00:04:20.708
<b>these are the only things that can attract.</b>

71
00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:25.041
<b>This might be the beginning of a relationship,</b>

72
00:04:25.041 --> 00:04:26.125
<b>but</b>

73
00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:33.166
<b>can any relationship endure solely</b>
<b>on these things for long?</b>

74
00:04:33.166 --> 00:04:34.791
<b>No, it cannot.</b>

75
00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:36.583
<b>One's character,</b>

76
00:04:36.583 --> 00:04:37.958
<b>their love,</b>

77
00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:39.458
<b>mutual understanding,</b>

78
00:04:39.458 --> 00:04:41.416
<b>inner beauty</b>

79
00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:46.916
<b>a lasting relationship depends</b>
<b>on all these qualities.</b>

80
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:55.541
<b>And when these essential human needs</b>
<b>are fulfilled, outer beauty ceases to matter.</b>

81
00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:58.833
<b>Understand this in two ways.</b>

82
00:04:58.833 --> 00:04:59.750
<b>First</b>

83
00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.125
<b>for success in relationships</b>

84
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:04.541
<b>look within yourself constantly,</b>

85
00:05:04.541 --> 00:05:06.416
<b>keep improving,</b>

86
00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:10.041
<b>strive continuously to become better.</b>

87
00:05:10.041 --> 00:05:11.250
<b>Second</b>

88
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.791
<b>for any relationship</b>

89
00:05:12.791 --> 00:05:17.916
<b>don't make outer glamour your measuring stick.</b>

90
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.666


91
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:29.291
<b>Just as the soul dwelling within is</b>
<b>more important than the body,</b>

92
00:05:29.291 --> 00:05:30.583
<b>Similarly,</b>

93
00:05:30.583 --> 00:05:36.416
<b>inner personality is more important</b>
<b>than outer garments.</b>

94
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:43.041
<b>Speaking of garments, in worldly life we wear</b>
<b>two types of clothes </b>

95
00:05:43.041 --> 00:05:45.291
<b>some made of fabric,</b>

96
00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:50.000
<b>others woven from our words.</b>

97
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.750
<b>Clothes made of fabric,</b>

98
00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.708
<b>to present our body,</b>

99
00:05:54.708 --> 00:05:56.708
<b>Clothes made of words,</b>

100
00:05:56.708 --> 00:05:57.625
<b>arguments,</b>

101
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:01.291
<b>to present our thoughts.</b>

102
00:06:01.291 --> 00:06:02.458
<b>But</b>

103
00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:03.625
<b>sometimes,</b>

104
00:06:03.625 --> 00:06:08.666
<b>we take debates so personally</b>

105
00:06:08.666 --> 00:06:11.041
<b>that we forget the real issue</b>

106
00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:15.500
<b>and become entangled in</b>
<b>merely winning arguments.</b>

107
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.916
<b>We become fixated on making our</b>
<b>verbal garments shine,</b>

108
00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:22.541
<b>our arguments weigh heavy</b>

109
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:24.958
<b>right or wrong loses meaning,</b>

110
00:06:24.958 --> 00:06:30.166
<b>victory in debate becomes our only goal.</b>

111
00:06:30.166 --> 00:06:33.958
<b>These are signs of ego,</b>

112
00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:38.416
<b>where instead of learning,</b>
<b>we're only eager to teach;</b>

113
00:06:38.416 --> 00:06:42.041
<b>abandoning the search for "what is right,"</b>

114
00:06:42.041 --> 00:06:49.083
<b>we become consumed with proving</b>
<b>"we are right."</b>

115
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:51.708
<b>No matter who wins the argument,</b>

116
00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:56.166
<b>true knowledge surely loses in such debates.</b>

117
00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:58.000
<b>Listen more,</b>

118
00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.333
<b>understand more,</b>

119
00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.750
<b>speak less.</b>

120
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.875
<b>And whatever you speak,</b>

121
00:07:02.875 --> 00:07:04.708
<b>speak for the subject's benefit,</b>

122
00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:08.416
<b>speak for mutual enlightenment,</b>

123
00:07:08.416 --> 00:07:10.250
<b>not for victory or defeat.</b>

124
00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:15.291
<b>This mindset will help you in professional life too.</b>

125
00:07:15.291 --> 00:07:16.916
<b>Relationships will improve</b>

126
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:19.416
<b>and personality will flourish.</b>

